1. prior written authorization from the Licensor; and
2. full payment of the applicable commercial license fee.

See [COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md](./COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md) for the commercial
licensing process. That document is an invitation to request a license and
does not itself grant commercial rights.

## Legacy MIT releases

Versions and copies of Punk Skill that were released under the MIT License
remain available under the MIT License that accompanied those versions. The
license change does not revoke or restrict rights already granted for those
legacy copies.

The last legacy MIT release must be identified in the release history as
`v1.0.0-mit`. Its license text is preserved in
[LICENSE-MIT-LEGACY](./LICENSE-MIT-LEGACY).

